      "text": "The anguish siktempora emits a terrible scream in a 30-foot emanation. Creatures in the area must attempt a DC 33 Will save save. The anguish siktempora can't use Scream of Despair for 1d4 rounds.\n\n---\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature takes 2d6 mental damage, 2d6 sonic damage, and is Frightened 1.\n\nFailure The creature takes 6d6 mental damage, 6d6 sonic damage, and is Frightened 2.\n\nCritical Failure As failure, but Frightened 3 and the creature gains weakness to mental 15 (this weakness applies to this Scream of Despair).\n\nEffect: Scream of Despair"
